e first token. I really want to make this interaction warm and welcoming so the user feels invited to share their thoughts!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hi — I’m LoopAI Doctor Agent. I can help you think through symptoms, red flags, likely possibilities, and sensible next steps in a careful, preliminary way. What would you like to work on today?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fbce8392a27b77c0169bad2ad773481918ab4bace6d258e54\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2158,"output":79,"cacheRead":9600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11837,"cost":{"input":0.0053950000000000005,"output":0.001185,"cacheRead":0.0024,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00898}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773851295459}}
